      "category": "team",
      "content": "Missing rate limit on password protected clips.\n\nRate-limits is a non-qualifying bug at this time. \n\nWe have received multiple reports of this in the past, however, since that time we have implemented a clip password rate limit. \n\nThis was not appropriately applied to all clip password areas, so we've decided to award reputation points for pointing this particular issue out.",
